### name: mis.not-text.len-of-bin
--- note
BIN is not TEXT even though both are 'strings' in most host languages.
FROM_UTF8 is the explicit conversion; there is no implicit one.
--- source
LEN(TO_UTF8("x"))
--- expect
error E_NOT_TEXT at 1:5
===
### name: mis.not-text.upper-of-bin
--- source
UPPER(TO_UTF8("x"))
--- expect
error E_NOT_TEXT at 1:7
===

